alert-level-epsilon = Epsilon
alert-level-epsilon-announcement = Central Command has ordered the Epsilon security level on the station. All heads of staff are to step down from their positions and await Central Command orders.
alert-level-epsilon-instructions = Crewmembers are to listen to Central Command operators for more information.

alert-level-theta = Theta
alert-level-theta-announcement = NanoTrasen has ordered the Theta security level on the station. Consider all contracts terminated.
alert-level-theta-instructions = Consider all contracts terminated.

alert-level-tau = Tau
alert-level-tau-announcement = Central Command has ordered the Tau security level on the station. All crew may mobilise as necessary to fend off the current threat. All permit requirements and prerequisites for arms possession are hereby lifted for the duration of the alert.
alert-level-tau-instructions = Crewmembers are to ensure their own survival and the survival of their peers.